cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use QiskitOpt.jl, cite this wrapper using this metadata. Also cite
  upstream Qiskit and Qiskit Optimization when using their quantum algorithms
  and simulators, as described in the README.
title: "QiskitOpt.jl"
type: software
authors:
