abstract: >-
  A JuMP and QUBODrivers interface for IBM Qiskit and Qiskit Optimization
  variational quantum algorithms (QAOA and VQE).
repository-code: "https://github.com/JuliaQUBO/QiskitOpt.jl"
license: MIT
version: "0.7.2"
date-released: 2026-10-25
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.7535883"
keywords:
  - Julia
  - Qiskit
  - QAOA
  - VQE
  - quadratic unconstrained binary optimization
  - QUBO
